WEBVTT

00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:03.780
Namaste. Har dukaan mein helper aur staff hote hain.

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:11.626
Roz kaun aaya, kisne advance liya, aur mahine ke ant mein kitni salary banti hai, ye hisaab ab app mein hai.

00:00:11.626 --> 00:00:13.733
Ye kirana ka public demo hai.

00:00:14.144 --> 00:00:20.979
More menu mein Staff attendance and salary. Pehle People tab mein logon ko jodte hain.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:24.555
Ramu mahine ki salary par hai, baarah hazaar.

00:00:24.937 --> 00:00:31.313
Shyam roz ki mazdoori par aata hai, paanch sau rupaye roz. Daily wage chunte hain.

00:00:31.313 --> 00:00:35.668
Kisi ko login dene ki zaroorat nahi, bas naam kaafi hai.

00:00:36.048 --> 00:00:44.830
Ab Attendance tab, roz ka register. Ramu aaj nahi aaya, to A dabate hain, absent. Shyam aaya hai, P, present.

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:50.872
Mahine ki salary waale ke liye sirf na aane waale din mark karne hote hain.

00:00:50.872 --> 00:00:54.659
Baaki din apne aap kaam ke din gine jaate hain.

00:00:56.422 --> 00:01:05.646
Salary tab mein har insaan ka card hai: kitne din kaam kiya, kitna bana, kitna advance diya, aur kitna dena baaki hai.

00:01:05.646 --> 00:01:09.633
Ramu ek din nahi aaya, to ek din ka paisa kat gaya.

00:01:10.452 --> 00:01:17.823
Beech mahine Ramu ko do hazaar advance chahiye. Give advance, do hazaar, cash, save.

00:01:17.823 --> 00:01:25.983
Ab dena baaki do hazaar kam ho gaya. Mahine ke ant mein Pay salary se baaki salary dete hain.

00:01:26.359 --> 00:01:29.535
Har card par Slip on WhatsApp ka button hai.

00:01:29.535 --> 00:01:36.464
Isse staff ko uske phone par salary slip jaati hai: salary, chhuttiyan, advance, aur kitna mila.

00:01:36.464 --> 00:01:40.290
Staff ko bhi saaf hisaab dikhta hai, shaq nahi rehta.

00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:48.688
Aur jo advance ya salary cash mein di, wo Daily summary mein bhi dikhti hai, Staff salary and advances paid today mein.

00:01:48.688 --> 00:01:51.317
Isse shaam ka galla bhi sahi milta hai.

00:01:52.347 --> 00:02:01.603
To staff ka poora kaam: People mein naam jodo, roz haazri, zaroorat pe advance, mahine ke ant mein salary aur WhatsApp par slip.

00:02:01.603 --> 00:02:02.398
Dhanyavaad.
